   "answer": {
    "type": "open",
    "generated_by": "source",
    "solution": "$\\begin{array}{rl}\\nabla f(x,y,z) & =\\frac{2x^{2}+2xy+6y^{2}-8xz-2z^{2}}{{(2x+y-4z)}^{2}}\\mathbf{i}-\\frac{x^{2}+12xy+3y^{2}-24yz+z^{2}}{{(2x+y-4z)}^{2}}\\mathbf{j} \\\\ & +\\frac{4x^{2}-12y^{2}-4z^{2}+4xz+2yz}{{(2x+y-4z)}^{2}}\\mathbf{k}.\\end{array}$"
